Subject: [PATCH 1/3] blockdev: Move the DPS module here

The partition type GUIDs from the Discoverable Partitions Specification
lived in bootc-lib, while bootc-internal-blockdev kept its own copies of
the ESP and BIOS boot ones because it can't depend on bootc-lib. Move
the module into the blockdev crate as `dps` and use it from both, so
there's one copy of each GUID.

