Subject: [PATCH 2/3] blockdev: Add XBOOTLDR partition lookup

Prep for writing composefs boot entries to an Extended Boot Loader
Partition next to the ESP.

Only VFAT partitions count, since the firmware has to read what's on
them; an ext4 /boot that's typed as XBOOTLDR for GRUB is left alone.

Assisted-by: AI
Signed-off-by: Kristof Imeri <kristof@lanth.me>
(cherry picked from commit 12400f78111ad6c02ce4a8f879e249d504f04062)
---
